 - 2026-06-11: RETIRE the agreement-as-selector claim (the Deep-Think 'demote selection R&D' directive + the pending retire_if_same_verdict): independent-induction AGREEMENT failed to EXECUTE its powered confirmation 3 milestones running (.369 poison-skip, .370 pending_execution, .371 execution_floor_unmet -- the clean pool yields 13 events vs the 19 the binomial gate needs) AND the chain-arms round already showed agreement is a CONFIDENCE LABEL, not a precision selector (p=0.0625 ns; precision indistinguishable from a single fresh chain's 0.73). Per retire_if_same_verdict, RETIRE the agreement-as-selector line: log it confidence-label-only in ops/verifier_registry.yaml, add to the GAP ledger / exclusion manifest as appropriate, and DO NOT queue precision-confirmation v4 or further agreement variants. KEEP the shipped demo-fit execution safety-gate (the zero-loss abstention wrapper is the trust product -- this retires the R&D to make selection SMARTER, not the gate itself). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: agreement_selector_retired_confidence_label_only; results/experiment_4023_retire_agreement_selector.json
